{"id":"657973","name":"蘑菇炒牛肉","author":"蓝雨阳光780913","authorId":"11379263","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/657973/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"牛肉","amount":"300g"},{"name":"蘑菇","amount":"300g"}],"sub":[{"name":"香菜","amount":"50g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"蘑菇剪掉根部洗净。","img":"images/657973/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切成片。","img":"images/657973/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入清水煮。","img":"images/657973/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"煮到变软捞出沥水。","img":"images/657973/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"牛肉切片够放入鸡蛋抓匀，再放入胡椒粉和要抓匀去腥入味。","img":"images/657973/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"油热以后，放入牛肉片翻炒。","img":"images/657973/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入香菜段炒香入味。","img":"images/657973/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入煮好的蘑菇翻炒。","img":"images/657973/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入姜碎，蒜碎和小米辣翻炒入味。","img":"images/657973/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入盐调味。","img":"images/657973/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"出锅。","img":"images/657973/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}